    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dojo City</strong> is a 3D action video game set in a reimagined, present-day New York City that is overrun by out-of-control martial arts dojos.<br><br>Use a variety of combos, weapons, and stealth to defeat your enemies.  <br><br><strong>Features:</strong> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Local Party Mode from two to up to four players<br></li><li>Online Battle up to 10+ players<br></li><li>In-depth combat in a fully roaming 3D environment<br></li><li>Weapon and environment interactions</li></ul><br><i>Please note: All images and videos are of actual gameplay. </i>",
